WEBVTT

00:02:59.897 --> 00:03:02.830
A Love Letter to Travel
by Debbie Millman

00:03:03.863 --> 00:03:06.830
My work has taken me all over the world.

00:03:06.863 --> 00:03:09.297
There have been many early departures,

00:03:09.297 --> 00:03:11.463
and many evenings in the air.

00:03:11.997 --> 00:03:15.830
In all my travels,
I've been struck by so many things.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.363
I've observed how people lived

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:20.730
in some of the most ancient
places on the planet.

00:03:21.397 --> 00:03:23.030
This is Machu Picchu.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.230
This is Easter Island.

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:26.897
This is Samoa.

00:03:27.597 --> 00:03:29.130
This is Angkor Wat.

00:03:29.897 --> 00:03:32.030
This is Petra in Jordan.